Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:13:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 37/47] metal(cpu-vkfft): pipeline FFT against gridding - FFT
 is now free

Two vkFFT buffers, submit() decoupled from wait(): plane N transforms
while N+1 grids and N-1 extracts. At 4096/2amin FFT+extract wall time
drops 1.43s -> 0.34s and the inversion 6.79s -> 6.02s, gate unchanged
(5.24e-06). Also removes the per-tap modulo and vectorises the w-shift
phase.

